      "back": {
        "text": "I'm pleased to meet you that we met.",
        "notes": "[\u02c8t\u025b\u0283i\u02d0 ma]\n\nTe\u0161\u00ed ma is a common greeting expression meaning pleased to meet you or nice to meet you, literally it pleases me."
